these are 52 facts about one piece that  you probably didn't know oda originally  planned for the series to only last for  five years with the main antagonist  being the emperors but his plans would  be extended mostly due to his creation  of the warlords of the sea the  supernovas who have now played pivotal  roles since their introduction were  actually a last minute addition to the  story they were created at sabori and  oda initially had no real plans for them  till he made them zorro is initially the  only member of the supernovas who  doesn't have a devil fruit this is  because killer ate a defective smile  fruit in wano which technically now  makes him a devil fruit user what we are  talking about zorro did you know that he  was initially going to be a bodyguard to  the one and only buggy the clown panda  man a non-canon easter egg character  appears in several parts of the manga  and has even made animated appearances  in some one-piece movies even though it  seems like a lot the events from the  moment luffy leaves to become a pirate  till the start of the time skip all took  place in a space of only four months  while the anime took around 12 years to  get to that point crocodile the  sichibukai who controlled alabasta  briefly thought luffy was using haki  during their fight he considered it by  saying could it be thanks to the manga  cover stories we would find out that mr  two survived his fight with magellan and  would go on to become the new queen of  level 5.5 where the okamas live and  party another interesting fact about mr  two or bon clay is that unlike the other  members of the baroque works he never  had a female partner and this was  because he identifies as both male and  female this next fact is only based on  the manga since they first met each  other there has never been a moment in  the story where zoro called sanji by his  name sanji created an alias called mr  prince during a small period in alabasta  and it would later be revealed that he  was in fact an actual prince during the  whole cake island arc sanji's origins  were also teased when he told the crew  he came from the north blue and it would  be revealed later on that it was indeed  where his place of origin the germa  kingdom was during the later parts of  dressrosa where a wanted list of all the  heroes was being shown we never see  conjuro and this was a great hint  showing that he was the mole amongst the  odin retainers well before his first  introduction at wano there was a brief  tease of the sun god nika during the  skypia arc in the scene while luffy was  dancing for a moment he resembled the  silhouette of nikka that was shown when  jinbe and who's who fought this was  meant to serve as a parallel of luffy  becoming the sun god which was further  hinted via the reveal of his devil fruit  true name minotomosan was a gag  background character created by oda to  fix the door that magically reappeared  just after higuma the bandit destroyed  it he is an incredibly skilled grumpy  short man who can't help but fix broken  doors just like manatomo-san and  pandaman another gag background  character created by oda is sam a  bald-headed drunk all three of them have  appeared across one piece media as quick  nods and easter eggs luffy once made a  weird sketch of a creature that shares  striking similarities to frankie before  frankie was even introduced to the story  jinbe planned to be a straw hat ever  since he met luffy but due to the world  changing after the events of marineford  he had to partner with the big mom  pirates for the sake of his people he  would eventually free himself from his  vow to her and join the straw hats  officially during the wano arc rooma the  legendary samurai of wano made his manga  debut way before the one-piece thriller  bark arc in oda's brief multi-chapter  series called wanted the rumors chapter  was called monsters and saw the journey  of a younger rumor wanting to be the  strongest warrior in the land the  original pitch for one piece was titled  romance dawn and released in the wanted  series it shared similar beats to one  piece but had differences like the  mentor figure to luffy not being shanks  fans of the series noticed that a lot of  the usop's lies would slowly turn out to  be true some examples of these lies  manifesting are tontara land existing  the huge mole with miss merry christmas  dragon on punk hazard cerberus on  thriller bark giant goldfish and more  way before their introduction at  dressrosa noland had visited tontatas  and it was mentioned during the skypia  flashbacks oda is very specific with his  chapter numbers and often plans out  certain chapters for big reveals for  instance gear 2 was introduced in  chapter 387 and gear 4 in chapter 783  while the one piece movies are usually  not canon we would get a specific piece  of canon info in film z during a bathtub  scene with the male straw hats aokiji  would interrupt them briefly and it  would be revealed that aside from his  scars he also lost his leg during the  battle with akainu at punk hazard this  is because logia users cannot regenerate  severely injured limbs did you know that  sanji was initially going to be called  naruto yeah that's right but due to the  success of kishimato's shonen series  called naruto he had to scrap the idea  all the marine admirals introduced in  the series including green bull were  based on famous japanese actors oda  loves films and that's why he based the  original three admirals on kuni tanaka  yasuko matsura and banta suguara who are  well known actors in japan besides the  marines other characters are based on  several popular real people too for  instance frankie's design mirrors that  of jim carrey and aceventura and ivankov  is based on frank n furter from rocky  horror show oda decided to give luffy  devil fruit that will grant him  rubber-like abilities because he wanted  the series to keep its wacky fun and  childlike energy no matter how serious  things got in the story brook talked  about hearing about a rookie by the name  of roger this was because he was already  a seasoned pirate years before roger  went out to sea with raylai well this  might sound surprising considering the  story of one piece primarily focuses on  the life and adventures of pirates no  pirate in the story makes use of an eye  patch however oda confirmed that a  pirate with an eye patch would appear at  the end of the series so all fans should  make sure they keep their eyes peeled  open for that towards the final chapters  oda's story of one piece is very  original but he also does a lot of  research and is very fascinated by  things like films books and history  that's why characters like blackbeard  jewelry bonnie and alvida are all based  on real-life pirates two of the gorosei  share striking facial similarities to  two very popular men namely mahatma  gandhi and mikhail gorbachev the milk  maiden who gets saved from blackbeard's  minions by the revolutionary army during  the reverie arc actually made her first  appearance a long time before that she  appeared exclusively on the manga cover  page which showed her hanging out with  ace the revolutionary army ship is  called the wind grandma which is based  off the grandma a real-life yacht used  to transport 82 cuban combatants who in  the 1950s planned to overthrow fulgencio  batista from his place of power oda  shares a birthday with port gus d ace  and the date is december 31st new year's  eve oda has publicly admitted that the  hardest characters for him to draw on  the story are shirahoshi and boa hancock  dragon leader of the revolutionary seems  to mostly lack the childlike personality  that luffy and garp possess however he  does happen to share something else with  them just like his other family members  he does have a mark on the left part of  his face via his special tattoos robin  and usop are the crew members in charge  of giving haircuts amongst the straw  hats sabo the revolutionary and  long-lost brother of luffy would turn  out to have the same design as a  character in the manga that was shown in  a crowd way back at the log town during  luffy's planned execution by buggy this  has never been officially confirmed but  due to sabo's temporal amnesia at the  time and dragon's presence at low town  it makes a lot of sense another  interesting bit of low town was  lightning that interrupted the execution  and hit buggy this lightning was most  likely created by the leader of the  revolutionaries and luffy's father  dragon he was present at low town during  that time and even had a brief  altercation with smoker nami is the  third smartest character to come out of  east blue with only ben beckham and  captain kuro being smarter than her this  was officially stated by oda himself  usopp's birthday is on april 1st and  it's extremely fitting because that's  the april fool's day and he's a very  good liar oda initially planned for  goldie rogers iconic facial hair to  actually be nasal hair but thankfully  that idea was changed oda stated that  akainu's devil fruit has the strongest  defensive power and that he'd probably  get to the one piece quickly if he went  out to search for it this coupled with  his extremely heated personality is why  he's arguably the most dangerous admiral  in the story law's devil fruit is so  important that the world government  would be willing to pay 5 billion  berries for it in his original design  chopper was actually drawn as a weird  reindeer zebra hybrid who had a very big  interest in smoking cigarettes oda's  editor shimizu has publicly stated that  while the end of marine fort and ace's  storyline resonated with a lot of fans  the ending of one piece itself will be  much more touching than that part of the  story whitebeard edward newgate and  blackbeard marshall d teach share the  first and last name of the real-life  blackbeard whose name was edward teach  oda has stated that if he could get any  devil fruit from the series it would be  robbins since it would allow him to draw  faster oda's wife jiaki inaba happened  to be a one-piece fan and he saw her  while she performed on stage as nami the  cat burglar click on this video where we  explained all luffy's forms in one piece  go on click it
 

